  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 6713075109888
    m_Localized: The employee struggles to maintain eye contact during conversations.
      The employee tend to avoid verbal exchanges with familiar coworkers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6753474646016
    m_Localized: The employee often fails to modulate voice force or speed of speech.
      The employee struggles to make oneself understood in routine social environments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6773607305216
    m_Localized: The employee interacts with strangers mainly. The employee hesitates
      and struggles to understand the nuances of body language.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803978260480
    m_Localized: The employee struggles to join multiple conversations and can struggle
      to understand open questions or indirect ones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6823855067136
    m_Localized: The employee joins short conversations but avoids broader social
      contexts. The employee struggles to underestand jokes or sarcasm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6844553957376
    m_Localized: The employee often stops oneself while talking then the employee
      repeats phrases or words stereotypically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6868033671168
    m_Localized: The employee provides simple information but the employee struggles
      to control facial expression or gestures properly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6891114926080
    m_Localized: The employee joins daily verbal exchanges only when encouraged.
      The employee avoids new or unceratin issues.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6910115123200
    m_Localized: The employee manages routine conversations with clarity and consistency.
      The employee follows and respects basic social rules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6932344934400
    m_Localized: The employee takes part in everyday discussions with awareness of
      conversational turn-taking and occasional hesitation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6984266223616
    m_Localized: The employee expresses ideas clearly with tone and pace management
      though still showing a preference for familiar topics or personal interests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7002251399168
    m_Localized: The employee communicates effectively in daily contexts with good
      listening and verbal comprehension skills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022048514048
    m_Localized: The employee interacts confidently even with new interlocutors with
      understanding of nonverbal cues and implicit social rules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7058278912000
    m_Localized: The employee manages everyday group conversations effectively with
      balanced attention among different interlocutors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7082245165056
    m_Localized: The employee provides information clearly in any daily context and
      can control tone and register of voice according to the interlocutor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7106421133312
    m_Localized: The employee shows excellent understanding of implicit social meaning
      with appropriate language adaptationacross varied situations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7128101490688
    m_Localized: The employee communicates fluently and coherently in all daily situations.
      The employee adapts language and tone of voice to context and audience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7151052722176
    m_Localized: The employee explains complex concepts with clarity with precision
      of language and strong summarizing skills, often linked to deep personal interests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178676408320
    m_Localized: The employee demonstrates excellent communication skills in all
      daily contexts. The employee ntegrates attention to details and expositive
      precision, which are traits often observed in autistic individuals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7204286828544
    m_Localized: The employee manages complex daily interactions with full control
      over language and expressions with advanced discourse structuring and strong
      attention to detail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10493640380416
    m_Localized: The employee prefers to spend most of the time alone. The employee
      spontaneously avoids social contact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10518793621504
    m_Localized: The employee shows little interest in joining group activities.
      The employee tends to isolate even in familiar settings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10542017482752
    m_Localized: The employee rarely engages with others. The empployee seeks solitude
